NMNING,				/ NO MEANING TO WHAT HE PUT IN
	JMS	MVINPT		/ COPY INPUT FROM MENU FIELD		/A037
	JMS	NOMEAN		/ TYPING "" HAS NO MEANING HERE		/A037
