	JMP	RSTNAM	/ GO RESTORE THE NAME OF THE DOCUMENT		/A032
	ISZ	TOSMAL							/M032
	JMP I	TOSMAL	/ HIT FINALLY HIT RETURN
RSTNAM,									/A032
