DISP1,	XX
	DCA	DISP11	/ PUT MESSAGE INTO CALL LIST
DISP10,									/A018
	JMS I	TOPSC	/ GO ERASE AND DISP '--COPY DOCUMENT--'		/A018
	CIFMNU	
